&quot;) center / contain no-repeat"></span>Huur en betalen</a></li><li class="lg:-translate-y-24 -translate-y-16"><a style="clip-path:polygon(calc(100% - 0px) calc(100% - 40px), calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.3333)) calc(100% - 40px), calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.3333)) calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.6667)), calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.6667)) calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.6667)), calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.6667)) calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.3333)), calc(100% - 40px) calc(100% - calc(40px * 0.3333)), calc(100% - 40px) calc(100% - 0px), 0 100%, 0 0, 100% 0)" class="group leading-none md:w-48 md:h-44 lg:text-lg text-neutral-900 hover:text-neutral-900 block h-36 p-5 pt-3 pr-12 underline decoration-neutral-900/50 lg:no-underline bg-warning-500 hover:bg-warning-300" href="/ik-huur#buren-en-buurt" target="_self"><div class="twic-i h-20 w-20 mb-4 group-hover:hidden "><div class="twic-w twic-tf" style="height:100%;padding-top:0" title=""><img alt="" style="object-fit:cover" data-twic-transform="/focus=auto/*" data-twic-src="media:7c99baa6-a893-4443-aef9-60aa81501740/090AC91F-4846-4F5D-807E-2AE038F5DEF3/Beeldtaal WB_Buren en buurt (003).png" data-twic-step="100"/><div style="background-size:cover"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-20 w-20 mb-4 hidden group-hover:block bg-white" style="mask:url(&quot;/media/090AC91F-4846-4F5D-807E-2AE038F5DEF3/Beeldtaal WB_Buren en buurt (003).png&quot;) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;/media/090AC91F-4846-4F5D-807E-2AE038F5DEF3/Beeldtaal WB_Buren en buurt (003).png&quot;) center / contain no-repeat"></span>Buren en buurt</a></li><li><a style="clip-path:polygon(calc(100% - 0px) calc(100% - 40px), calc(100% - 40px) calc(100% - 40px), calc(100% - 40px) calc(100% - 0px), 0 100%, 0 0, 100% 0)" class="group leading-none md:w-48 md:h-44 lg:text-lg hover:text-neutral-900 block h-36 p-5 pt-3 pr-12 underline lg:no-underline bg-tertiary-500 hover:bg-tertiary-300 text-white decoration-white/50" href="/ik-huur#wonen-en-verhuizen" target="_self"><div class="twic-i h-20 w-20 mb-4 group-hover:hidden "><div class="twic-w twic-tf" style="height:100%;padding-top:0" title=""><img alt="" style="object-fit:cover" data-twic-transform="/focus=auto/*" data-twic-src="media:7c99baa6-a893-4443-aef9-60aa81501740/A0F64482-860E-4CC8-AD21-EBACDD5416D4/Beeldtaal WB_Woning en contract (004).png" data-twic-step="100"/><div style="background-size:cover"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-20 w-20 mb-4 hidden group-hover:block bg-tertiary-500" style="mask:url(&quot;/media/A0F64482-860E-4CC8-AD21-EBACDD5416D4/Beeldtaal WB_Woning en contract (004).png&quot;) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(&quot;/media/A0F64482-860E-4CC8-AD21-EBACDD5416D4/Beeldtaal WB_Woning en contract (004).png&quot;) center / contain no-repeat"></span>Woning en contract</a></li></ul></nav><div class="px-5 lg:px-0  lg:py-10 flex flex-col gap-4"><div class=""><div class="flex gap-4"><div id="readspeaker_button1" class="rs_skip rsbtn rs_preserve flex"><a rel="nofollow" class="rsbtn_play" title="Laat de tekst voorlezen met ReadSpeaker webReader"><span class="rsbtn_left rsimg rspart"><span class="rsbtn_text"><span>Lees voor</span></span></span><span class="rsbtn_right rsimg rsplay rspart"></span></a></div></div></div><h1 id="Samen-maken-we-de-buurt!" class="text-3xl md:text-6xl leading-none max-w-md font-medium text-primary-500 rs-read">Samen maken we de buurt!</h1><h2 class="text-md md:text-lg text-neutral-800 leading-tight rs-read">Al meer dan 100 jaar zorgen wij voor fijn wonen in de buurt. Ook bij jou in de buurt waar jouw thuis je basis is. Dat doen we samen met onze medewerkers, bewoners en partners voor ruim 70.000 bewoners in Eindhoven, Helmond en omstreken.</h2></div></div></div><script>$RC("B:1","S:1")</script><div hidden id="S:2"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row featured-image lg:max-w-7xl lg:mx-auto lg:justify-end items-stretch lg:items-center"><div class="bg-secondary-50 gap-4 flex flex-col p-5 pb-36 -mb-28 lg:mb-0 lg:-mr-28 lg:pr-60 lg:pl-28 lg:py-16 xl:ml-28"><h2 id="Uitgelicht:-Ouderen-Vakantieweek-brengt-buurtbewoners-in-Tongelre-samen" class="text-secondary-900 text-xl md:text-3xl">Uitgelicht: Ouderen Vakantieweek brengt buurtbewoners in Tongelre samen</h2><div class="prose font-light prose-p:my-4 first:prose-p:mt-0 last:prose-p:mb-0 prose-h2:mt-8 first:prose-h2:mt-0 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h2:text-lg md:prose-h2:text-2xl prose-a:text-sm prose-a:font-normal prose-a:text-primary-500 prose-a:underline-offset-4 prose-a:decoration-1 prose-a:decoration-primary-500/50 prose-a:transition-colors hover:prose-a:text-neutral-950 hover:prose-a:decoration-neutral-950"><p><span style="color:rgb(86, 95, 103)">“Ik woon al 44 jaar in Tongelre en heb mezelf nooit echt thuis gevoeld. Maar nu... voel ik me thuis.” Deze uitspraak deelde een oudere bewoner uit Tongelre. Hij kwam naar de Ouderen Vakantieweek bij woongemeenschap ‘t Rondeel en vond het fantastisch.</span></p></div><a target="_self" class="button disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-25 inline-flex outline-none focus:outline-offset-0 focus:outline-2 px-8 font-medium py-3.5 text-xs md:text-sm bg-neutral-800 text-white hover:bg-primary-500 hover:text-white active:text-neutral-800 active:bg-accent focus:outline-primary-500 gap-4 items-center pr-6 hover:pl-10 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out w-fit mt-3" href="/bewonersverhalen/ouderen-vakantieweek-brengt-buurtbewoners-in-tongelre-samen">Lees meer<svg aria-hidden="true" width="15" height="12" viewBox="0 0 15 12" fill="currentColor" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.8371 10.3765V7.1486H0V4.85229H8.7345L8.7339 1.62379L8.8371 0L15 6.01969L8.9403 12L8.8371 10.3765Z"></path></svg></a></div><div class="mx-5 lg:mx-0 relative lg:w-full lg:max-w-md" style="clip-path:polygon(0px clamp(80px, (100vw - 799px) * 1000, 120px), calc(clamp(80px, (100vw - 799px) * 1000, 120px) * 0.0785) calc(clamp(80px, (100vw - 799px) 